{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/Movie_078-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745399300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Reaper Hunt: Survivor</strong></u> is a single-player action roguelike shooter that merges fast-paced bullet hell combat with strategic depth in a dark, atmospheric world of magic and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one of the unique characters, each boasting distinct abilities tailored to different playstyles. Venture into ever-changing levels through dynamic portals that transport you to new, unpredictable arenas teeming with relentless foes and formidable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Available content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6+ enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3+ biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">skill tree, upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a lot of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/Movie_084-ezgif.com-cut.gif?t=1745399300\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/Movie_089-ezgif.com-cut.gif?t=1745399300\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/Movie_080-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1745399300\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551540?t=1745399300","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551540?t=1745399300","capsule_image":"https://shared.a